            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"I didn't know it could feel like this\"",
            "details": "I've had anxiety my entire adult life. Thought it was just my personality — the overthinking, the jaw clenching, the chest tightness.\nFirst day wearing this I was driving and realized it was quiet. My brain wasn't so LOUD.\nI've been wearing it for 7 weeks. My therapist asked what changed. I showed her my wrist.",
