        "r2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"I wore it to my mother-in-law's dinner. Didn't lose my mind once.\"",
            "details": "I snap. At everyone. Not because I'm angry — because I'm on edge ALL the time.\nAshwagandha stopped working after 2 months. CBD did nothing. Breathing exercises made me MORE panicky.\nThis took about a week. The edge softened. I cooked dinner without rage for the first time in I don't know how long.",
            "author_name": "RACHEL V.",
