            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"Maybe this is what normal feels like\"",
            "details": "I've never NOT had anxiety. Thought everyone felt like this — tight chest, knot in stomach, replaying every conversation.\nAround day 5, I noticed I wasn't gripping the steering wheel as hard. Shoulders were down. Jaw was loose.\nBy week 3 I said to my husband 'is this what normal feels like?'\nI wear it every day. I touch it when I start to spiral. It helps.",
