            "tag_1": "Lifelong Anxiety",
            "tag_2": "First Time Calm",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"My daughter said 'mom you're not grumpy anymore'\"",
            "details": "That broke me. Because she was right. I WAS grumpy. Not because I wanted to be — because my body was in survival mode and I had nothing left by 5pm.\nTried magnesium, ashwagandha, 3 rounds of CBT, briefly considered Lexapro.\nThis bracelet was my 'fine, one more thing' purchase. 10pm, Instagram ad.\nBest impulse buy of my life.",
            "author_name": "JEN W.",
            "tag_1": "Survival Mode",
            "tag_2": "Mom of 3",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.8",
            "quote": "\"The hum finally stopped.\"",
            "details": "I didn't even know there was a hum until it stopped. That constant background tension — the scanning, the bracing, the 'something bad is about to happen' feeling.\nI'd normalized it. I thought everyone felt like that.\nWeek 2 of wearing this, I was sitting on the couch and realized I was just... sitting. Not scanning. Not planning. Not bracing. Just sitting.\nI don't know the science. I just know my nervous system finally shut up.",
